{"abstract":"In this rule, the Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) amends the Export Administration Regulations (EAR) to revise the existing Validated End-User (VEU) list for the People's Republic of China (PRC) by updating the list of eligible items in the EAR for Samsung China Semiconductor Co. Ltd. and SK hynix Semiconductor (China) Ltd. In addition, this rule makes corresponding changes consistent with the scope of the amended authorizations for these VEUs.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2023/10/17/2023-22873.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"748","title":15}],"citation":"88 FR 71478","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective October 17, 2023.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 231010-0244"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2023-10-17","updated_at":"2024-03-05T16:56:26.853-05:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS-2024-0006-0001","allow_late_comments":null,"id":"BIS-2024-0006-0001","comment_end_date":null,"regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false}],"supporting_documents_count":0,"id":"BIS-2024-0006","title":"Existing Validated End-User Authorizations in the People’s Republic of China: Samsung China Semiconductor Co. Ltd. and 